        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alison Pargeter, Julia Smith, Tony Holland, Mary Slessor\n- Productions: EastEnders, Mary Slessor, Rock & Chips, Only Fools and Horses\n- Organizations: BBC, BBC One\n- Roles: Sarah Cairns, Val\n\nFacts:\n- EastEnders is a British soap opera created by Julia Smith and Tony Holland that has been broadcast on BBC One since 1985.\n- Alison Pargeter was born on 31 May 1972 and is an English actress.\n- Alison Pargeter played Sarah Cairns, a stalker, in the BBC soap opera EastEnders.\n- Alison Pargeter played Mary Slessor in the 11-part television series Mary Slessor.\n- Alison Pargeter played Val, a Nag's Head barmaid, in Rock & Chips, the BBC prequel to Only Fools and Horses.",
